<title>HUNGARY: CESI INDEX HITS NEW RECORD, ENDS AT 1,567.29 PTS.</title>
<headline>CESI INDEX HITS NEW RECORD, ENDS AT 1,567.29 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index hit the third record daily high in a row on Monday, closing at 1,567.29 points, up 1.44 points or 0.09 percent, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
